1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Källor
2 CONT Källa: Hudiksvall AI:18b (1871-1881) Bild 267 / Sida 261
2 CONT Samma hushåll
2 CONT Cnejus Wejdling	1833-03-13	
2 CONT Emma Wilhelmina Joachimsson	1837-02-24	
2 CONT Anna Sophia Elisabeth	1865-03-28	
2 CONT Carl Andreas	1867-08-21	
2 CONT Cnejus Joachim	1869-10-27	
2 CONT Livius Fredrik Wilhelm	1872-06-20
2 CONT
2 CONT Weidling, Cuejus
2 CONT Ny 294/V
2 CONT Död 1902-02-16.
2 CONT Kyrkobokförd i Gävle, Gävle stad (Gävleborgs län, Gästrikland).
2 CONT Född 1833-03-13 i Skänninge, Skänninge stad (Östergötlands län, Östergötland).
2 CONT Änkling (1892-07-31).
2 CONT Motsvarande folkbokföringsförsamling(ar) 1/1 2023:
2 CONT Gävle, Gävle kn (Gävleborgs län, Gästrikland)
2 CONT Källor:
2 CONT DB, FS (sida: 652)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Cnejus moved to Trankil in 1858 from Skänninge, where he had a illigitimate child with Marthe. He moved away in 1860. For a while he was a Merchant/Trader, and seemed to move around alot. He last was an accountant.
2 CONT
2 CONT from a swedish genealogy board, tracking the many moves and occupations of Cnejus (semi translated from Swedish)
2 CONT
2 CONT Derfor a short list of hvor Cnejus has vært resident: Skänninge 1833-1850. Use Student of Tarn og Fösked in Nyed (Värmland) 1850-1851, melds moving, til Lower Ullerud (Värmland) in 1851, but Dukker up in Karlstad stadsforsamling 1
2 CONC 850-1852, Gustaf Fors uses (Gustavus Adolphus parish, Värmland) 1852-1853. Stjernfors use in North Ullered (Värmland) 1853-1854. Mitander Fors mill in Bogen (Värmland) 1854-1855. Bruksbokholder on Vägsjöfors in Vitsand (Värmland) 
2 CONC 1855-1856. Wood kroekvernen in Âlvkarlaby (Gävleborg) 1856-1857. Gävle 1857-1858. As trading in Skänninge 1858, in the western parts Holm in Trankil (Värmland) 1858-1860. On Denningarums in eastern Broby (Kristianstad) from 1860 t
2 CONC o 1863, he married Emma Wilhelmina's Joakimsson 1861st In Älmhult in Stenbrohult Assembly in 1863, in Bökhult in Pjätteryd (Kronoberg) 1863-1864. The carbolic acid in Färilla (Gävleborg) 1864-1866, 1867-1869. In the Gulf of Ytterh
2 CONC ogdal (Jamtland) 1866-1867. On the Nore in Ljusdal 1869-1871. Hudviksvall 1871-1873. In Hamre in Forsa 1873-1878. In Naret in Leksand 1878-1879. In Kyrckobyn in Orsa (Kopparberg) 1879-1882. Wood mill in Avesta Avesta 1882-1884. In
2 CONC  Sala 1884-1885. The Big Kopperbergs parish wood Falun 1885-1886, in Falu-Christina 1886-1888. The Church The root of Ovansjö (Gävleborg) 1888-1889. In Gävle, as an accountant from 1889.
2 CONT
