1 NAME Carl Edvard /Wejdling/
2 GIVN Carl Edvard
2 SURN Wejdling
2 NICK Carl Edvard Wejdling
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 22 MAY 1818
2 ADDR
3 STAE Östergötlands län
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 31 DEC 1897
2 ADDR
